{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31319","headline":"喷玉泉冥会诗八首 白衣叟喷玉泉感旧游书怀 · 李玖","name":"喷玉泉冥会诗八首 白衣叟喷玉泉感旧游书怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"树色川光向晚晴，旧曾游处事分明。\n鼠穿月榭荆榛合，草掩花园畦壠平。\n迹陷黄沙仍未寤，罪标青简竟何名。\n伤心谷口东流水，犹喷当时寒玉声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李玖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31319.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31319","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}